Why this is separate from the engine license
--------------------------------------------

The engine source is licensed under MPL-2.0 (see `/LICENSE`). That license is
written about software, and applies poorly to authored content. These files are
here to be read, copied and modified — they are the worked examples of how the
graph system is meant to be used, and learning the engine means taking them
apart. CC BY is the license that says so plainly.

This covers the *sample* content shipped in this repository. It is not a grant
covering content authored with the engine by anyone else, including content in
games built on it.
